@startuml pipeline_dag3_activity
' UML 2.5 activity diagram — DAG 3 dag_analytics_rollup (nightly at 23:30).
' Source: DE/dags/dag_analytics_rollup.py, dags/wrapper/analytics_rollup_wrapper.py.
' chord_attempts is written by the microphone practice mode (UC-06), which is planned:
' in the current build the table receives no rows and the DAG finds nothing to roll up.
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1F2937
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DiamondBorderColor #1F2937
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #6B7280
}

|DAG 3: dag_analytics_rollup (23:30 daily)|
start
:aggregate_attempts: read today's chord_attempts\nand compute accuracy per (user, chord);
note right: chord_attempts (PostgreSQL)
:rolling_accuracy: average today's accuracy with\nthe two previous days of the same (user, chord);
while () is ([(user, chord) row left])
  :update_mastery: recompute the mastery level\nand upsert user_chord_mastery;
endwhile ([all rows done])
stop
@enduml
